{"content":[{"c":["HOLON"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Town in the uplands of Judah’s inheritance (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.51","r":"Josh.15.51","rawR":"Josh.15.51","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.51","value":"Josh.15.51"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 15:51"},") given to the Levites (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.21.15","r":"Josh.21.15","rawR":"Josh.21.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.21.15","value":"Josh.21.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"21:15"},"). In ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.58","r":"1Chr.6.58","rawR":"1Chr.6.58","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.58","value":"1Chr.6.58"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 6:58"},", the town is called Hilen. Holon may be Khirbet ‘Alin, northwest of Hebron. ",{"c":["See"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=LeviticalCities_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"LeviticalCities_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"LeviticalCities_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Levitical Cities"},"."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. City near Heshbon, located in the plain of Moab (",{"href":"?bref=Jer.48.21","r":"Jer.48.21","rawR":"Jer.48.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.48.21","value":"Jer.48.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 48:21"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Holon","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 15:51","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.51","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.51","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.51"},{"anchorText":"21:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.21.15","rawQueryValue":"Josh.21.15","sourceRefExact":"Josh.21.15"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 6:58","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.58","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.58","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.58"},{"anchorText":"Jer 48:21","canonicalization":"deferre